Open Core Model
---------------

Xybrid uses an open-core licensing model:

OPEN SOURCE (Apache-2.0):
- xybrid-core: Core runtime library
- xybrid-sdk: High-level Rust SDK
- xybrid-cli: Command-line interface
- xybrid-macros: Procedural macros
- xybrid-flutter: Flutter plugin
- registry: Self-hosted bundle registry

COMMERCIAL (Proprietary):
- Xybrid Cloud Gateway: Managed LLM routing service
- Xybrid Cloud Registry: Hosted model distribution
- Xybrid Enterprise: RBAC, audit logs, SSO, SLA
- Xybrid Dashboard: Web management interface
- Xybrid Analytics: Usage metrics and cost tracking

